body:
Ah I think what I missed in the custom widget, you need to call helper.search() at the end of the line:

``` js
 options.helper.setQueryParameter('restrictSearchableAttributes', ...);
 options.helper.search();
```

I just tried this and it worked well:

``` js
var algoliasearch = require("algoliasearch");
var helper = require("algoliasearch-helper")
var client = algoliasearch('appid', 'key');
var helper = helper(client, 'indexName');
helper.setQueryParameter('restrictSearchableAttributes', ['categories']);
helper.search()
helper.setQueryParameter('restrictSearchableAttributes'); // not sent
helper.search()
```

The "helper" you are using is this: https://github.com/algolia/algoliasearch-helper-js
